<tr>
    <td  bgcolor="#c0c0c0" width="100%" valign="top"><tt><font color="#000000">
Author:&nbsp;<a href="/showmember.php?name=Quickening">Quickening</a>&nbsp;(---.dialinx.net)<br>
Date:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;03-27-01 22:27<br>
<br><HTML>As you read by Clunches post below mine, there's some interesting situations occurring within the guild right now. Somehow, I seem to be stuck in the middle of it with the Break and Gus situation.<br>
<br>
I havent talked to anyone about this really, preferring to keep this to myself, and not trouble the rest of you with it; but here's my decision.<br>
<br>
In two weeks time, if my mood doesn't improve, I'll be leaving the game. I might just delete my characters and start from scratch in blissful anonymity, or I may just cancel my account and save myself an extra 10 bucks a month. Or I may just leave the guild and be solo for awhile, so not to cause any more problems within the guild, as I've already done.<br>
<br>
I never EVER wanted Break or Gus to leave, I enjoyed the two of them, but enough was enough. 5 hours a day for 3 weeks (you were being nice on the time frame C) was more than I could stand, and I asked them to be quiet for a bit, and to top it off, I said it in a joking manor, as to not sound like I was on a power trip. Needless to say, this didnt work. Even a little bit. It tossed fuel onto a fire that was apparantly blazing as is. The insults went from being directed to me, then to the rest of the guild, which was inexcusable in my book. Then yesterday, Gus was on with his alt and told me that he '...really REALLY hated me.' <br>
<br>
I've had about e-fuc&ing-nough of this petty 12 year old BS. I'm sorry, but the fact remains that it went from personal attacks, to attacks on my family, to then telling me that they hate me. I don't stand for that. But the insults continue to fly, or at least they did, directed at the guild, all spurred on by me.<br>
<br>
So, despite urgings and advice from others, I've pretty much come to the conclusion that its not the boys (Break and Gus) that are the problem, but that its me. I dont know, maybe I AM overbearing as an officer, but I don't think I've been. Who knows.<br>
<br>
At any rate, 2 weeks is a LONG time, and anything could happen. I may wake up tomorrow and realize this was a rediculous rambling of a girl with her feelings hurt.<br>
<br>
Then again, maybe not.<br>
<br>
See ya all on EQ.<br>
<br>
J</HTML></font></tt><p>
